{
  "_comment": "Combat VFX mapping. 'effects' describe how a sprite is animated; 'rules' map gameplay events to an effect (first matching rule wins). Event keys: kind (damage|heal|block|apply_status|status_tick|draw|gain_energy), card_id, specialization_id, status_id, target_group (card target: self|single_enemy|single_ally|all_enemies|all_allies). Presentation only: nothing here changes gameplay. Optional effect keys: opacity (peak alpha), group_fit (draw one sprite over a multi-target group, as a share of the group width), group_max (design-px cap for that sprite), anchor (center|ground), impact (effect spawned when a projectile lands). kinds enemy_attack / enemy_defend are announced when an enemy intent resolves (target = the party member hit / the enemy itself).",
